      "side": 1,
      "message": "Here we are calling the same function(i.e. is_sink(peer)) multiple times (for logging its called again) and we seem to only log if it is sink. We should also log if it is source.  We could do one of the following -\n\nOption 1:\nbool is_sink \u003d ...;\nbool is_source \u003d ...;\nLOG_INFO(\" is_sink \u003d %d, is_source \u003d %d \", is_sink, is_source)\nif(is_sink) source_on_idle(); \nelse if(is_source) sink_on_idle():\n\n\nOption 2:\nif(btif_av_peer_is_sink(peer)) { \n   LOG_INFO(is sink \u003d TRUE)\n   source_on_idle()\n} else if(btif_av_peer_is_source(peer)) { \n   LOG_INFO(is source \u003d TRUE)\n   sink_on_idle()\n}",
